extends layout

block content
  section.faq-page
    .faq-layout
      figure.faq-graphic
        img.faq-image(
          src="/images/faq-image.png"
          alt="Abraham Lincoln wearing a customer support headset, with the caption: Let's keep this civil."
          width="887"
          height="1774"
        )

      section.faq-content(aria-labelledby="faq-heading")
        header.faq-header
          h1#faq-heading Frequently Asked Questions
          

        .faq-list
          details.faq-item
            summary.faq-question
              span Are these actual historical artifacts?
              span.faq-toggle(aria-hidden="true")
            .faq-answer
              p No. History Showroom is a parody shop with fictional relic listings. The Smithsonian can relax.

          details.faq-item
            summary.faq-question
              span Why is the Liberty Bell already broken?
              span.faq-toggle(aria-hidden="true")
            .faq-answer
              p You're looking at the premium feature. An intact one would raise more questions.

          details.faq-item
            summary.faq-question
              span Who authenticates the relics?
              span.faq-toggle(aria-hidden="true")
            .faq-answer
              p Our expert checks every item against the certificate he just wrote. We consider this a very efficient system.

          details.faq-item
            summary.faq-question
              span Can I pay with Confederate money?
              span.faq-toggle(aria-hidden="true")
            .faq-answer
              p We accept that you tried.

          details.faq-item
            summary.faq-question
              span What if my relic is haunted?
              span.faq-toggle(aria-hidden="true")
            .faq-answer
              p Ask the original owner for a receipt. If they start talking about tariffs, set aside the afternoon.

          details.faq-item
            summary.faq-question
              span How accurate are the product descriptions?
              span.faq-toggle(aria-hidden="true")
            .faq-answer
              p Every item has a story. Some even had one before we wrote the listing.

          details.faq-item
            summary.faq-question
              span Can I speak to the manager?
              span.faq-toggle(aria-hidden="true")
            .faq-answer
              p Mr. Lincoln is currently trying to keep the team together.

          details.faq-item
            summary.faq-question
              span Can I use this website for my history class?
              span.faq-toggle(aria-hidden="true")
            .faq-answer
              p If the assignment is about unreliable sources, we're an excellent case study.